<title>UK: Crest in 3.8 mln stg buy from Rexam.</title>
<headline>Crest in 3.8 mln stg buy from Rexam.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crest Packaging Plc on Thursday said it had acquired Rexam Cartons and Print South from Rexam Plc for 3.8 million stg cash.</p>
<p>Rexam Cartons, principally engaged in the manufacture of folding cartons for customers in a number of consumer goods markets, made a loss before interest of 0.9 million stg in 1996 on sales of 12.7 million.</p>
<p>&quot;Notwithstanding this, there has been a significant improvement in the trading results of Rexam Cartons in the first quarter of 1997,&quot; Crest said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
